            "review_title": "Review at Bello The Pizzeria",
            "review_text": "Luvtotravel999\nEdmonton, AB112 contributions\n0\nExactly what you want in a pizza!\nSep 2026 • Couples\nThin, crispy, cheesy pizza! Exactly what you're craving. They have a good selection of pizzas at a very reasonable price. They also have pasta, burgers and wings, but we did not try them. Our pizzas arrived piping hot and quickly. If you're craving a delightfully light and air thin crust pizza with wnty of your favorite toppings this is where you want to be. It's not fancy, but neither is pizza. Do yourself a favor and go there! A very happy Canadian couple.\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2026",
