            "review_text": "Mashajo\nKaliningrad, Russia11599 contributions\n34\nWhen you want simple food\nJul 2025 • Solo\nLooking for a place to eat nearby, and I came across this place. Attracted by the cute name and that there were tables available. The establishment is small, located on a busy street. Inside, the environment is simple but cozy, the staff are friendly. Italian cuisine is on the menu at pleasant prices. I got spaghetti and shrimp in pesto sauce. The dish arrived about 20 minutes later. The paste looked great, the shrimp was big, the ration was fine. Honestly, I didn't expect much from this place, but the pasta turned out to be delicious, it was done well and balanced. The service is attentive and prompt. You can pay by card, which is convenient. If you want comfort food, you can eat here.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten December 9, 2025",
